      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 10: 🔴 This patch introduces `%ifn ...` in multiple NASM sources, but NASM/YASM conditional directives do not provide a plain `%ifn` form for boolean expressions. That makes the patched assembly invalid or toolchain-dependent. Use valid conditionals (`%if !ARCH_X86_64`, `%if !(ARCH_X86_64 \u0026\u0026 HAVE_AVX2_EXTERNAL)`, etc.) consistently across all affected hunks.",
      "revId": "f79d19ddf2efa5fc0cd20d07a34230530f3e5737",
