      "writtenOn": "2026-10-21T22:02:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 7: 🔴 The `-lz` special-case mapping was removed from `msvc_common_flags()`. On MSVC, generic `-l*` translation turns `-lz` into `z.lib` instead of `zlib.lib`, which can break link resolution for zlib users and cause feature-dependent build failures. Keep the existing `-lz -\u003e zlib.lib` mapping and add the new `-lmp3lame -\u003e libmp3lame.lib` mapping in addition to it, not instead of it.",
      "revId": "f79d19ddf2efa5fc0cd20d07a34230530f3e5737",
      "serverId": "1e26b4c1-6b8c-47ff-9df7-501b633d3b5a"
